if (story.url.toLowerCase().contains(phrase.toLowerCase())) {\n                shouldFilter = true;\n                break;\n            }\n        }\n    }\n    if (shouldFilter) {\n        filterIterator.remove();\n    }\n}\n```\n\nThis mirrors the existing logic in `loadStory()` exactly — case-insensitive substring matching against story titles (for filter words) and story URLs (for filter domains).\n\n**File modified:** `app/src/main/java/com/simon/harmonichackernews/StoriesFragment.java` (+24 lines)"}],"stop_reason":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":52064,"output_tokens":590,"cache_read_input_tokens":12576,"total_tokens":52654}}}
